# Concerto SQLite migrations
#
# Forward-only, numerically ordered: 0001_<name>.sql, 0002_<name>.sql, …
# `sqlx::migrate!("./migrations")` embeds each file into the binary and the
# migration runner applies any not yet recorded in `_sqlx_migrations`.
#
# Task 08 ships the runner with no migrations yet; Task 09 adds the first.
# This .gitkeep is here so the directory exists at build time (the
# `sqlx::migrate!` macro panics if the path doesn't resolve to a directory).
